      "bottom": 0.5256666666666667,
      "top": 0.645
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Observed coverage = demanded IDs returned by prefetch / all demanded IDs",
      "left": 0.07,
      "right": 0.897890625,
      "bottom": 0.3277777777777778,
      "top": 0.36
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Counts are unique within each HTTP request / Session, then summed over the workflow.\nThe denominator includes root reads and memory hits. This is not a database cache-hit rate.",
