    {
      "page": 10,
      "text": "RecipePantry Aggressive is an earlier capture; Conservative is the repaired November 11 version.\nA Session demand can be satisfied from memory. A higher coverage ratio does not by itself\nprove fewer SQL calls, less semantic waste, or lower latency.",
